w_m7nis_1a␀Alright, our first objective is to get to the command centre and neutralise their security network.  There'll be plenty of guards, so stay sharp.  Let's go.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m7conv_1a␀␀Ventilation shafts...they must have some sort of underground tunnel system.  Sewage maybe.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m7conv_1b␀␀Could be our best way in.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m7conv_2a␀␀They've got raw sewage running through these tunnels.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m7conv_2b␀␀At least it'll get us to the command centre.␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m7conv_3a␀␀Damn, I've been in some disgusting places, but-␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m7conv_3b␀␀Look, there's an opening up ahead.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m7conv_3c␀␀That must be the way in.␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m7conv_4a␀␀They've got a diagram of the mansion here on the wall.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m7conv_4b␀␀Looks like there's three separate entrances, the library, the conservatory, or the main door.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m7conv_4c␀␀Until we get a better look, let's keep our options open.␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m7conv_4d␀␀Sounds good.␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m7conv_5a␀␀The estate grounds are on the other side of this door.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m7conv_5b␀␀It's at least an inch and a half thick...solid steel.  There's no way we're opening it ourselves.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m7conv_5c␀␀We need to find the control room.  I can shut down the security system and override the door once we're inside.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
